  "body": "Discover the perfect balance of style and functionality in this contemporary freehold home. Ideally situated in the vibrant East Coast Heights community, this property offers a low-maintenance solution for busy professionals, growing families, or those seeking a 'lock-up-and-leave' lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStep inside to a bright, open-plan kitchen and dining area, ideal for everyday living and relaxed entertaining. The spacious lounge flows seamlessly to an easy-care patio - an inviting space for your morning coffee or evening unwinding. The ground floor is complete with a separate toilet for added convenience.\r\n\r\nRetreat upstairs to the master bedroom, a relaxing space complete with its own ensuite. Three additional bedrooms and a family bathroom are thoughtfully designed to accommodate various needs, whether it be for a growing family, guest rooms or a dedicated home office.\r\n\r\nOutside, enjoy three off-street car spaces, making coming and going a breeze for family or guests. This is true low-maintenance living - perfect for those who value their time and want a home that works with their lifestyle, not against it.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything! Set in a family-friendly community, this property not only provides a comfortable lifestyle but also represents a savvy investment opportunity. Just a short walk from the Hibiscus Coast bus station for a stress-free city commute, and moments from Silverdale shops, local parks, and recreational facilities. Families will love being close proximity to quality local schools, while quick access to the motorway keeps everything within easy reach.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure a home that truly has it all and a lifestyle designed for your future.",
